{% comment %}
  Renders Shopify admin policy pages (privacy, terms, refund, shipping, etc.)
  using the themed prose layout. Available at /policies/<handle>.

  Policy templates must be `.liquid` (JSON templates are not supported).
  https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/architecture/templates/policies

  The `policy` object exposes `title` and `body` from Settings → Policies in
  the Shopify admin, so any update there automatically reflects on the page.
{% endcomment %}

{% render 'page-prose',
  title: policy.title,
  body: policy.body,
  eyebrow: 'Policy'
%}
